Package: bayests
Title: Model Files, Model Lists and Model Comparison for 'BayesTS' Samplers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(c("Franz", "X."), "Mohr", email = "franz.x.mohr@outlook.com", role = c("aut","cre","cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-8890-7781"))
Description: The infrastructure shared by the R packages that run the samplers
    of the 'BayesTS' library, such as 'bvartools' and 'dfmtools': the generic
    functions of their model workflow, reading and writing model files in the
    'BayesTS' 'HDF5' layout, lists of models and expanding windows, running
    models through the 'BayesTS' command line, and comparing models. The package
    estimates no model of its own.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/franzmohr/bayests-r
BugReports: https://github.com/franzmohr/bayests-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: coda, grDevices, graphics, hdf5r, parallel, posterior (>= 1.7.0), stats, utils
Suggests: bvartools, loo (>= 2.10.0), testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
